			"notes": "Mod now available on [CurseForge PearlTickets](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pearltickets)!\n\nWhat's new in PearlTickets 1.1.2:\n- `Ender Pearl` won't disappear in `y < 0` areas.\n\nAs usual: \n- `Ender Pearl` can selectively load chunks (a replacement for nether portal chunk loading in 1.14+, resulting in significantly better performance than `enderPearlChunkLoading` in @gnembon/carpet-extra).\n- supports 1.17 series, 1.16 series, and 1.15 series."
		},
